| `suggest: reduce_load` | L1 | ❌ No | Kernel evalúa; si `Ω` permite, aplica |
| `request: thermal_cooldown` | L2 | ❌ No | S3 ajusta cgroup; log algedónico |
| `propose: reframe(V, parent)` | L3 | ✅ Sí | Bloqueado hasta `S5.approve` + BMC verify |
| `force: abort` | - | ✅ Sí + A9d | Solo si `critical_failure ∨ policy_violation` |

